  "instructions": [
    "Heat the coconut oil in a large saucepan over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and sauté until lightly browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and sauté for another minute.",
    "Add the cumin, coriander, turmeric, and red pepper flakes and cook for 1-2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the kidney beans, soy sauce, salt, and black pepper. Stir to combine.",
    "Reduce heat to medium-low and simmer, uncovered, for 20-25 minutes or until the sauce has thickened and the flavors have melded together.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning as needed.",
    "Serve hot over rice or with naan bread."
  ],
